  "content": "<p>這是我最早製作的模組之一。最初，我只是為了我自己和我的兄弟姐妹們創作了這個模組，但後來我意識到，其他人可能也會在他們的遊戲過程中享受這個模組！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這個模組將大約33張《UNDERTALE》的音樂唱片加入了Minecraft！</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>外加一首原本是為我妹妹準備的惡搞歌曲。C;</p>\n</div><p>我正在努力將這個模組更新到更多版本，並加入更多歌曲。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>音樂唱片只能在創造模式下的材料標籤中找到。</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.pnghttps://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/729/169/310/172/2023-09-14_13.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;在Minecraft中享受《UNDERTALE》的旋律吧！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>感謝MCreator，這是我學習製作模組的平台！</p><p>感謝toby fox創造了精彩的遊戲《UNDERTALE》及其令人驚嘆的原聲帶！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>請在評論中告知我任何錯誤。</p><p>你也可以建議新增的歌曲和/或功能！</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
